      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We couldn’t be happier with our Plico battery. From the sales team with the clear comms to the date start date that they lined up nicely with a day I could work from home, these guys  worked around my timeframe. The install team are legends. The guys arrived right at the agreed start time, clarifies the install location, we discussed the UPS circuits, they did the install in a few hours, left us with a well installed unit, took all the mess away and fixed a few issues they found in the switchboard. From the time they set up the system and we checked our app, the system has been working faultlessly for over a month. The system set up nicely on the internet page and we have a clear view on what the system is up to so we can make changes to our appliance use to make the most of the system. The savings are huge. We were expecting an 5 year return but after just 35 days, the system payback is targeted for less than 3 years.  We highly recommend Plico to anyone thinking about making the switch – it’s been one of the best home investments we have made. Just do it.",
